        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Bug 1891478 Implementation of `documentId` in more extension APIs]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44491</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44491"/>
        <updated>2026-06-19T19:53:53.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This change addresses the dev-doc-needed requirements of <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1891478" rel="nofollow">Bug 1891478</a> "Implement documentId in extension APIs"</p>
<p dir="auto">Changhes include:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>
<p dir="auto">New page</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>runtime/getdocumentid/index.md  — documents the new  <code class="notranslate">runtime.getDocumentId()</code>  method, which returns the document UUID for a given window/frame target.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">Updated API reference pages</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>runtime/connect/index.md  — added  <code class="notranslate">documentId</code>  to  <code class="notranslate">connectInfo</code>  options.</li>
<li>runtime/sendmessage/index.md  — added  <code class="notranslate">documentId</code>  to  <code class="notranslate">options</code>.</li>
<li>proxy/requestdetails/index.md  — added  <code class="notranslate">documentId</code>  and  <code class="notranslate">parentDocumentId</code>  properties.</li>
<li>webnavigation/getframe/index.md  — removed a stray orphaned "Must include one of" line.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">Navigation/index updates</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>runtime/index.md  — added a  <code class="notranslate">runtime.getDocumentId()</code>  entry to the methods list.</li>
<li>content_scripts/index.md  — added  <code class="notranslate">runtime.getDocumentId()</code>  to the list of APIs usable from content scripts.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">Release notes: firefox/releases/153/index.md  — new bullet under "Changes for add-on developers" summarizing all the  <code class="notranslate">documentId</code>  additions across  <code class="notranslate">runtime</code>,  <code class="notranslate">scripting</code>,  <code class="notranslate">userScripts</code>,  <code class="notranslate">tabs</code>,  <code class="notranslate">webNavigation</code>,  <code class="notranslate">webRequest</code>, and  <code class="notranslate">proxy</code>, referencing bug 1891478.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto">BCD changes in PR <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4669607685" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29853" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29853/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29853">mdn/browser-compat-data#29853</a></p>]]></content>
